Everything in this folder and in ../blocks, plus ../neko.txt, is original pixel
art drawn by tools/draw.py: the GIFs, their PNG stills, the half-block art and
the braille cat. It is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Use it for anything. Credit is nice but not required.
